:TEST-ID tests.codegen.core.math.runtime
:TEST-TIER regression
:TEST-CONTEXT monadc.context.core-libs
:TEST-PURPOSE Exported Math constants and functions execute safely through an imported Core module.
:TEST-EXPECT compile, run, stdout
:TEST-SECTION codegen
:TEST-EXPECT-STDOUT-B64 My4xNDE1OTI2NTM1ODk3OTMKNzIwCjU1ClRydWUKNTA1MAoxMjAKODEK

import Math
module Main []

show pi
show (factorial 6)
show (fib 10)
show (prime? 29)
show (sum-range 1 100)
show (product-range 2 5)
show (pow 3 4)
